# Repaired receiver: ordinary first-strike review

All eight paired ordinary routes pass on pinned current original ActorRuntime 672f9272 and repaired worker receiver 0aaf1689 with composed consumer 474212b4. Each worker first prepare/contact installs the original exact fitted plan. No original-admission call occurs during those ready phases; impact/recovery delegates to the original helper as intended. All 13 actors are loaded. The same Chrome process alternates original and worker routes; no additional idle wait, state injection, saved-state edit, private renderer read, free turn, or changed paid clock is used.

Each action spends exactly 4 displayed PA, changes target health once from 100 to 82, and retains current cells, owned Brown Bess, one charge, and 12 reserve cartridges. Errors are empty; all pinned source and served native body/equipment/bank bytes remain exact.

